# Line endings: shell scripts must keep LF (they run on Linux); Windows
# batch files keep CRLF. Everything else is normalised to LF in the repo.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.patch text eol=lf -whitespace
*.png binary
*.ico binary
